# Siege Run: your own models and textures (for example from BFME2) stay on your computer only.
# They're never committed, so they never reach GitHub or the public site.
siege-run/models/*
!siege-run/models/README.md
siege-run/textures/*
!siege-run/textures/README.md
siege-run/sabers/*
!siege-run/sabers/README.md
siege-run/levels/*
!siege-run/levels/README.md
